<template name="changelog">
<head></head>
<body>
<div>
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
        <ul>
            <li>Marazap requires constant aim</li>
            <li>Mantis and Creep effects are debuffed by armor</li>
            <li>Can shove people around</li>
            <li>Bsuits can walk over dretches</li>
            <li>Momentum and Vampire removed...
                <ul>
                    <li>Go to OM/RC and press "Q" to open Overload menu and purchase upgrades</li>
                    <li>On killed building, BP not recovered. Must always buy more.</li>
                    <li>Miners eventually give you money, not BP (takes a few minutes for money)</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>freem's chaingun (balance tweaked slightly)</li>
            <li>Human and Alien raid modes (with bosses) USE /callvote alienraid or /callvote humanraid</li>
            <li>Shrike Flying Alien</li>
            <li>New Shotgun and Mass Driver models</li>
        </ul>
    <h1>Shrike Guide</h1>
    <p>
        Shrike is a disruptor class. It can claw and fire blight barbs which temorarily disable a human buildable.

        Use alt-attack to start flying. Use crouch to stop flying. Use tertiaryAttack to fire barbs.
    </p>
</div>
</body>
</template>
